<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif; background: #f8f9fa; color: #333; padding: 40px 20px; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: auto; background: white; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); padding: 40px; }
      .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
      .icon { font-size: 60px; color: #E53E3E; }
      h1 { color: #00209F; font-weight: 700; margin: 20px 0 10px; }
      .alert-box { background: #fff3cd; border-left: 5px solid #ffc107; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 8px; }
      .actions { background: #e7f3ff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 25px 0; }
      .footer { margin-top: 40px; font-size: 13px; color: #888; text-align: center; }
    </style>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600&family=Montserrat:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.3.0/fonts/remixicon.css" rel="stylesheet">
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <i class="ri-shield-line icon"></i>
        <h1>Security Alert</h1>
      </div>

      <p>Dear <%= @citizen.full_name %>,</p>

      <p>We’re letting you know that access to your BonID data for <strong><%= @partner.name %></strong> was revoked on:</p>

      <p class="text-center fw-bold fs-5">
        <%= l(@revoked_at, format: :long) %>
      </p>

      <div class="alert-box">
        <p><strong>If you made this change</strong>, no action is needed — your data is now protected from this partner.</p>

        <p><strong>If you did NOT revoke this access</strong>, someone may have accessed your account.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="actions">
        <p><strong>Please take immediate action:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Change your password right away</li>
          <li>Enable two-factor authentication (OTP) if not already active</li>
          <li>Review recent login activity</li>
          <li>Contact us at <a href="mailto:support@bonid.ht">support@bonid.ht</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p>Your privacy and security are our top priority.</p>

      <p>— The BonID Team</p>

      <div class="footer">
        © 2025 BonID — Powered by the Haitian Digital Identity Network<br>
        <small>This is an automated security notification.</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>